* 1016_eval.sno — EVAL: evaluate unevaluated (deferred) expressions
* Rung 10. 3 assertions.

*       unevaluated concat expression — * defers evaluation
        expr = *('abc' 'def')
        DIFFER(EVAL(expr), 'abcdef')                   :f(e001)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 1016/001: eval concat expr'     :(END)
e001

*       unevaluated variable reference — evaluates to current value of q
        q = 'qqq'
        sexp = *q
        DIFFER(EVAL(sexp), 'qqq')                   :f(e002)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 1016/002: eval var ref'         :(END)
e002

*       unevaluated failing expression — eval fails, :f branch taken
        fexp = *IDENT(1, 2)
        EVAL(fexp)                                     :f(e003)
        OUTPUT = 'FAIL 1016/003: eval failing expr should fail' :(END)
e003

        OUTPUT = 'PASS 1016_eval (3/3)'
END
